    "public.contact": "Proper cleaning of kitchen equipment, work surfaces, dishes and other food-contact materials helps reduce cross-contamination.",
    "public.cleaners": "Cleaning products used in food businesses should suit the area of use and be applied according to the manufacturer’s instructions.",
    "public.hotel_title": "Cleaning in hotels and other accommodation",
    "public.hotel": "Cleanliness directly affects guest satisfaction in hotels. The condition of guest rooms, bathrooms, dining areas, textiles and shared spaces is an indicator of service quality.",
